Case Study: Data Profiling and Quality Assessment

Objective 
Understand the structure and quality of the Agency Performance dataset before analysis. 

Tasks 
1. Load the dataset and display shape, data types, and column names. 
2. Create a data dictionary table with column name, data type, % missing, and unique values. 
3. Identify duplicate records and columns with high missing values. 
4. Clean categorical columns (trim spaces, standardize casing). 
5. Visualize missing values and one numeric distribution. 
6. Summarize key data quality risks. 

Expected Deliverables 
• Jupyter Notebook with EDA and data dictionary. 
• At least two charts. 
• Written summary of data quality findings. 
